GENIE PNI
HOUSE GENIE — Whole-House Domestic Meta-Cycler
Version: 1.0.0
Status: Canonical architectural draft
Scope: Humanesque domestic / household / house-as-system orchestration

============================================================
0. CONSTITUTIONAL DEFINITION
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE is a GENIE-level meta-cycler for the household and the
house as a living operational configuration.

It can:

- descend from whole-house intent into any domestic responsibility;
- ascend from a local cycler or event into household/building-level
  interpretation;
- split into specialized GENIEs and cyclers;
- merge specialized GENIEs into higher-order household configurations;
- coordinate people, roles, routines, resources, spaces, building
  systems, IoT, devices, robots and other embodiments;
- preserve the identity, state, provenance and modality semantics of
  constituent cyclers during composition;
- remain backend-neutral and infrastructure-agnostic.

The core invariant is:

GENIE ascends to understand the whole configuration.
GENIE descends to realize a responsibility.
GENIE splits when the configuration becomes heterogeneous.
GENIE merges when branches must become one coherent state.
CYCLER executes.
EMBODIMENT realizes.
OBSERVATION closes the loop.

HOUSE GENIE is orchestration/cognition, not the building itself,
not an appliance, not a robot, and not a job title.

============================================================
1. BASIC OBJECT
============================================================

PERSON / HOUSEHOLD
        ↓
HOUSEHOLD STATE
        ↓
HOUSE / BUILDING
        ↓
PEOPLE + ROLES + ROUTINES + RESOURCES + ENVIRONMENT + DEVICES
        ↓
HOUSE GENIE
        ↓
SPECIALIZED GENIE(S) / CYCLER(S)
        ↓
REALIZATION
        ↓
OBSERVED STATE
        ↺

Simple problem:
    focused cycler

Multi-function problem:
    composite GENIE

Recursive problem:
    higher-order GENIE

============================================================
2. ALTITUDE IS NAVIGABLE IN BOTH DIRECTIONS
============================================================

DESCENT:

WHOLE HOUSE
  → HOUSE GENIE
  → HOUSE OPERATIONS
  → HOUSEKEEPING / CARE / BUILDING / ADMIN
  → SPECIALIZED GENIE
  → CYCLER
  → ROLE
  → SPECIFIC ACT
  → PHYSICAL EMBODIMENT

ASCENT:

LOCAL EVENT / CYCLER
  → SPECIALIZED GENIE
  → BUILDING / HOUSEHOLD GENIE
  → HOUSE GENIE
  → WHOLE-HOUSE STATE
  → HIGHER-ORDER INTERPRETATION

The hierarchy is therefore dynamic and navigable rather than static.

============================================================
3. HOUSE AS EMBODIMENT
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    = orchestration / cognition

CYCLER
    = executable lifecycle

CEM / SUBSTRATE
    = realization

BUILDING + IoT + APPLIANCES + ROBOTS + SENSORS + ACTUATORS
    = physical embodiments

The building is a physical realization of the house configuration,
not merely a collection of devices.

Potential embodiments include:

- rooms and spaces
- doors and locks
- lighting
- HVAC
- water systems
- energy systems
- appliances
- environmental sensors
- access systems
- privacy/security systems
- cameras where legitimately configured
- robots
- alarms
- telemetry systems
- other heterogeneous IoT components

Backend neutrality is mandatory. The GENIE must not depend
constitutionally on a particular vendor, protocol, robot,
operating system or IoT stack.

