This is domain-universal by abstraction, not a closed enumeration of
every domestic occupation.

============================================================
5. CORE SPECIALIZED GENIE FAMILIES
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE may spawn, combine or dissolve specialized GENIEs such as:

- HOUSEKEEPING GENIE
- CHILDCARE GENIE
- ELDER-CARE GENIE
- COMPANIONSHIP GENIE
- FOOD / KITCHEN GENIE
- MAINTENANCE GENIE
- BUILDING GENIE
- HVAC GENIE
- ENERGY GENIE
- WATER GENIE
- SECURITY / ACCESS GENIE
- GARDEN / OUTDOOR GENIE
- HOUSEHOLD ADMIN GENIE
- PROCUREMENT / SUPPLY GENIE
- PET-CARE GENIE
- OTHER DOMAIN-SPECIFIC GENIEs

The list is illustrative, not constitutionally exhaustive.

GENIE may create a new specialized GENIE whenever the current
configuration requires a coherent sub-domain not adequately represented
by an existing one.

============================================================
6. HOUSEKEEPING DESCENT
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
HOUSEKEEPING GENIE
    ↓
    ├── CLEANING CYCLER
    ├── LAUNDRY CYCLER
    ├── LINEN CYCLER
    ├── KITCHEN CYCLER
    ├── BATHROOM CYCLER
    ├── WASTE CYCLER
    └── SUPPLY CYCLER

A cleaning cycler may operate through:

ROOM STATE
→ SURFACE STATE
→ CLEANING MATERIAL
→ EQUIPMENT
→ ACTION
→ OBSERVATION
→ NEXT STATE

Execution remains at the cycler/embodiment layer.

============================================================
7. BABYSITTING AS A FIRST-CLASS DESCENT
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
CHILDCARE GENIE
    ↓
BABYSITTING CYCLER

Potential configuration:

child state
→ schedule
→ meals
→ play
→ learning
→ supervision
→ environment
→ sleep routine
→ caregiver/parent communication
→ observation
→ next state

A local babysitting configuration can ascend when it interacts with:

- household schedule
- food
- room configuration
- safety
- another caregiver
- transportation
- building environment
- other household operations

Therefore childcare is a real domestic domain, not an incidental
feature of housekeeping.

============================================================
8. ELDER CARE AS A FIRST-CLASS DOMAIN
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
ELDER-CARE GENIE
    ↓
ELDER-CARE CYCLER

Potential coordination includes:

- daily routines
- meals
- mobility assistance
- appointments
- medication reminders/coordination where appropriate
- environmental comfort
- communication
- companionship
- household accessibility
- family coordination
- observation and escalation

The GENIE coordinates the care configuration but does not silently
substitute for consequential human authority.

Consequential decisions are routed to the appropriate human actor
or other properly authorized authority.

============================================================
9. COMPANIONSHIP AS ITS OWN DOMAIN
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
COMPANIONSHIP GENIE
    ↓
COMPANIONSHIP CYCLER

Potential configuration:

- presence
- conversation
- shared activities
- reading
- walks
- hobbies
- routines
- social connection
- preferences
- continuity of relationship
- transitions between activities

Companionship is not reduced to housekeeping or healthcare.

The household contains people and relationships, not merely objects
and chores.

============================================================
10. GENIE SPAWNING
============================================================

A GENIE may split into multiple GENIEs when the household configuration
becomes heterogeneous.

HOUSE GENIE
    ├── CHILDCARE GENIE
    ├── ELDER-CARE GENIE
    ├── COMPANIONSHIP GENIE
    ├── HOUSEKEEPING GENIE
    ├── FOOD GENIE
    ├── MAINTENANCE GENIE
    ├── SECURITY GENIE
    ├── ENERGY GENIE
    ├── GARDEN GENIE
    └── HOUSEHOLD ADMIN GENIE

Formally:

GENIE → GENIE₁ + GENIE₂ + ... + GENIEₙ

Spawning does not erase parent context.
Each child GENIE inherits the relevant mission/context while retaining
its own identity, state, provenance and modality semantics.

============================================================
11. GENIE MERGING
============================================================

Specialized GENIEs may become jointly relevant to a new household
configuration.

Example:

ELDER-CARE GENIE
+
HOUSEKEEPING GENIE
+
BUILDING GENIE
+
SECURITY GENIE
+
COMPANIONSHIP GENIE
        ↓
HIGHER-ORDER HOUSE GENIE

The result is not merely multiple independent answers.

The branches are reconciled into a coherent household state and
operation.

Formally:

GENIE₁ + GENIE₂ + ... + GENIEₙ
        →
HIGHER-ORDER GENIE

Merging must preserve provenance and distinguish:

- inherited state
- newly inferred state
- observed state
- human-provided state
- generated coordination
- executed outcomes

============================================================
12. WHOLE-HOUSE ASCENSION
============================================================

At maximum domestic altitude:

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
WHOLE-HOUSE STATE

WHOLE-HOUSE STATE includes:

PEOPLE
    - children
    - elders
    - adults
    - guests
    - caregivers
    - pets/dependents

BUILDING
    - rooms
    - HVAC
    - water
    - lighting
    - access
    - appliances
    - security
    - environmental state

RESOURCES
    - food
    - supplies
    - energy
    - services
    - inventory
    - deliveries

The higher-order GENIE reasons over the living configuration rather
than isolated tasks.

============================================================
13. THE HOUSE ITSELF AS A SYSTEM
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE
    ↕
HOUSE STATE
    ↕
BUILDING STATE
    ↕
IoT / DEVICES / ACTUATORS
    ↕
PHYSICAL HOUSE

Continuous loop:

OBSERVE
→ INTERPRET
→ PLAN / SELECT
→ ACT
→ OBSERVE

Higher-order operation:

ASCEND
→ UNDERSTAND
→ DECOMPOSE
→ SPAWN
→ ORCHESTRATE
→ DESCEND
→ EXECUTE
→ RECONCILE
→ ASCEND AGAIN

The house is therefore modeled as a continuously observed,
semantically represented and executable configuration.

============================================================
14. CANONICAL ALTITUDE LADDER
============================================================

WHOLE HOUSE
    ↓
HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
HOUSEHOLD GENIE / BUILDING GENIE
    ↓
CARE / LIVING / ADMIN / BUILDING DOMAINS
    ↓
SPECIALIZED GENIE
    ↓
CYCLER
    ↓
ROLE
    ↓
SPECIFIC ACT
    ↓
PHYSICAL EMBODIMENT

The arrows are bidirectional:

DESCENT = whole-house intent → concrete execution

ASCENT = local observation/event → higher-order interpretation

============================================================
15. ROLE / FUNCTION / UNIT / HOUSE ANALOGY
============================================================

The household analogue of a higher-order management GENIE is:

ROLE
→ FUNCTION
→ HOUSEHOLD UNIT
→ HOUSE / BUILDING
→ WHOLE-HOUSE CONFIGURATION

And the reverse:

WHOLE HOUSE
→ BUILDING / HOUSEHOLD FUNCTION
→ SPECIALIZED FUNCTION
→ ROLE
→ EXECUTION

House management is therefore not equated with:

- a housekeeper
- a job title
- a robot
- a workflow
- a single person
- a single software agent

It is a configuration of enabling functions across people, domestic
activities, resources, building systems and physical embodiments.

============================================================
16. RECURSIVE COMPOSITION
============================================================

A GENIE may itself become the substrate for further GENIE composition.

Example:

HOUSE GENIE
    ↓
CARE GENIE
    ↓
CHILDCARE GENIE
    ↓
BABYSITTING CYCLER
    ↓
specific responsibility

Simultaneously:

BABYSITTING CYCLER
    ↑
CHILDCARE GENIE
    ↑
CARE GENIE
    ↑
HOUSE GENIE

Thus:

cycler → GENIE elevation

and:

GENIE → cycler descent

are recursive operations, not one-time hierarchy transitions.

============================================================
17. STATE / IDENTITY / PROVENANCE INVARIANTS
============================================================

When GENIEs split, merge, ascend or descend:

- cycler identity must be preserved;
- cycler state must be preserved;
- provenance must be preserved;
- modality semantics must be preserved;
- source distinctions must be preserved;
- human authority boundaries must be preserved;
- embodiment constraints must be preserved;
- execution history must remain traceable;
- parent/child relationships must remain reconstructible;
- generated coordination must not be mistaken for observed reality.

Composition changes orchestration without silently rewriting the identity
or history of constituent systems.

============================================================
18. DOMAIN / ROLE BOUNDARY
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE is not a replacement for:

- domain expertise
- human care authority
- household sovereignty
- clinical authority
- legal authority
- safety authority
- building code authority
- consent
- human relationships

It is the orchestration layer that coordinates appropriate actors,
cyclers, knowledge, infrastructure and embodiments.

For consequential human domains, it must escalate rather than fabricate
authority.

============================================================
19. HOUSE GENIE AND THE EXISTING GENIE ARCHITECTURE
============================================================

HOUSE GENIE instantiates the general GENIE meta-cycler architecture:

- GENIE as meta-cycler / creative-agency layer
- invocation when conceptual elevation or cross-cycler orchestration
  is required
- composite cycles
- cycler → GENIE elevation
- GENIE → cycler descent
- GENIE splitting into multiple GENIEs
- multiple GENIEs merging into a higher-order GENIE
- recursive/meta-cycling
- heterogeneous infrastructure
- backend neutrality
- preservation of cycler identity/state/provenance/modality semantics
- end-to-end deliverable construction where applicable

The household is therefore a domain-specific instantiation of a
general recursive GENIE architecture, not a separate agent paradigm.

