============================================================
22. ESSENTIAL INVARIANT
============================================================

GENIE ASCENDS TO UNDERSTAND THE WHOLE CONFIGURATION.

GENIE DESCENDS TO REALIZE A RESPONSIBILITY.

GENIE SPLITS WHEN THE CONFIGURATION BECOMES HETEROGENEOUS.

GENIE MERGES WHEN BRANCHES MUST BECOME ONE COHERENT HOUSEHOLD STATE.

CYCLERS EXECUTE.

CEM / SUBSTRATES REALIZE.

EMBODIMENTS ACT IN THE PHYSICAL WORLD.

OBSERVATION CLOSES THE LOOP.

HOUSE GENIE is therefore:

A recursive domestic meta-cycler capable of moving from the whole
house to the smallest legitimate domestic responsibility and back,
while coordinating people, care, household operations, building
systems and heterogeneous physical embodiments without collapsing
their identities or authorities.

